'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI证实正自研人形机器人及数据中心特种机器人</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">ChatGPT、Claude等海外头部大模型突发大规模宕机持续超3小时</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌9月4日起停用安卓端Google Assistant，全面切换至Gemini</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d4c56ca5191ff6c5b5ae4b6a63a0c6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于9月4日起正式在安卓手机端逐步停止Google Assistant服务，并将符合条件的用户迁移至Gemini。此次调整覆盖智能手表、耳机及Android Auto等依赖手机智能功能的设备，而Android电视、机顶盒及内置Google服务的汽车暂不受影响。迁移过程预计持续数周，对于不满足Gemini配置要求或未开放服务的地区，Google Assistant将保留一段时间，但大多数用户将在未来两个月内失去访问权限。谷歌表示，此举旨在将“嘿，谷歌”语音入口从传统助手转向生成式AI交互。尽管Gemini在复杂任务处理上具备优势，但在计时器、音乐播放等高频指令的响应稳定性与准确性上仍面临挑战。此次迁移标志着谷歌正通过生成式AI全面重构Android生态的系统级交互逻辑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达宣布以129.3亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式宣布以129.303亿美元收购开源人工智能平台Hugging Face。作为全球开源模型核心枢纽，Hugging Face目前拥有超1800万开发者，托管超过300万个模型、50万个数据集及100万个应用，服务超20万家企业。英伟达此前已在该平台发布500多个模型及250多个开放数据集。英伟达CEO黄仁勋承诺，收购完成后Hugging Face将保持独立开放属性，继续支持各类开源及开放权重模型，并坚持多云与多加速器发展路线。黄仁勋强调，此次收购旨在利用英伟达的基础设施与工程能力，将开放式AI平台推向新规模，而非将其改造为封闭的硬件入口。此举意在通过开放权重技术，降低初创公司、高校及企业使用先进AI能力的门槛，推动AI在工厂、医院、课堂等场景的落地，进一步增强全球开放AI生态的均衡发展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI证实正自研人形机器人及数据中心特种机器人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b86d0f100045a3facaa2d35ab82d7c28.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI CEO山姆·奥尔特曼近日证实，公司正推进机器人研发，布局人形机器人与数据中心特种机器人两条技术路线。奥尔特曼强调，机器人形态并非核心，关键在于“机器人大脑”，新发布的GPT-6 Astra模型被视为机器人落地的核心基础。OpenAI Robotics事业部已由Sora负责人阿迪亚·拉梅什领导，旧金山地区机器人相关岗位扩招至19个，硬件执行器设计成为研发重点，涵盖电磁、齿轮设计及测试基础设施。奥尔特曼表示，家用机器人并非当前首要任务，基础设施与制造业场景是落地重点，但长期看好消费级市场。目前，OpenAI尚未披露具体的发货日期与产量目标，研发核心在于实现机器人硬件与机器学习的深度协同设计。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ffbe77738741cca256b1fa6bd79cba81.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind 与 Google Research 联合发布 WeatherNext 3 天气模型，通过直接接入实时全球静止卫星拼图与原始气象站观测数据，解决了传统 AI 模型分辨率低及初始化依赖滞后数据的问题。该模型采用函数生成网络（FGN）网格 Transformer 架构，输出分辨率最高达 0.05°（约 5 公里）。在运行机制上，模型实现每小时刷新，其中 00、06、12、18 UTC 可预报至 15 天，其余时段覆盖 48 小时。相比前代，WeatherNext 3 在降水预报方面显著提升，短时预报 CRPS 较基线最高提升 60%。此外，模型针对可再生能源需求，提供 100 米风速、云层分布及太阳辐照等关键变量。目前，该模型预测数据已通过 BigQuery、Earth Engine</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT、Claude等海外头部大模型突发大规模宕机持续超3小时</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6c291c0e954e49b085d2530517daa36f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美东时间9月3日上午9点23分，全球AI领域发生罕见故障，ChatGPT、Claude、Grok、谷歌Gemini及微软Copilot等多款海外头部大模型集体瘫痪，服务中断时间长达3小时40分钟，严重影响了海外用户的日常办公与API技术调用。此次大规模宕机暴露了海外主流AI服务在基础设施稳定性方面的脆弱性。与之形成鲜明对比的是，国内大模型在同一时间段内保持了平稳运行。智谱等国内AI企业通过社交平台公开回应称“我们还在线”，侧面印证了国内大模型在底层技术韧性与基础设施承载能力上的可靠性。此次事件对依赖海外模型API的开发者及企业用户敲响了警钟，凸显了在AI应用部署中考虑基础设施冗余与多模型备份策略的必要性。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
